{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iANUjGx9UZ1795558368.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>神舟二十四號載人飛船將於早上8時18分發射升空，航天員湯洪波、武毅，及來自巴基斯坦的齊尚‧阿里出席出征儀式。現場有學生揮舞鮮花，氣氛非常熱烈。</p><p></p><p>指令長湯洪波表示：「我們奉命執行神舟二十四號載人飛行任務，準備完畢。」</p><p></p><p>總指揮下令出發，三名航天員正式領命出征。現場響起歌曲，航天員向民眾揮手告別，民眾揮舞國旗，有人用手機拍下珍貴畫面。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.884859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T21:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:17.957591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:37.599328+00:00","content_hash":"3da9903155978ab1121e93d2cbf815019dc320192cb5d5aead531fc5848a8fca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.884859+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}